@startuml
hide empty description
skinparam Shadowing false	
skinparam ArrowFontSize 20
skinparam State {
  AttributeFontColor black
  AttributeFontName serif
  AttributeFontSize  20
  BackgroundColor white
  BorderColor black
  EndColor black
  FontColor black
  FontName Sanserif
  FontSize 20
  FontStyle bold
  StartColor black
  ArrowColor black	
}

Start: entry/ Turn on the pump and the chiller. t=:0
CheckPrime: entry/ t=:0 \nCheck if the pump is primed.
Running: Circulation is running normally.
Leaking: entry/ t=:0 \nCheck if there is a leak in the circulation.
Off: entry/ Turn off the pump and the chiller.

[*] --> Start: /

Start --> CheckPrime: t>=1s
CheckPrime --> Running: FLOW_OK
CheckPrime --> Off: t>=prime_check_timeout 
Running --> Leaking: LEAK_DETECTED
Running --> CheckPrime: FLOW_LOW
Leaking --> Off: t>=leak_check_timeout
Leaking --> Running: FLOW_OK
Start --> Off: OFF
CheckPrime --> Off: OFF
Running --> Off: OFF
Leaking --> Off: OFF
@enduml